Endpoint = vpn.example.com:51820
AllowedIPs = 10.99.0.0/24
PersistentKeepalive = 25
! Peer phone of wireguard office enrolled with 10.99.0.3/32.
! warning: this token holds the peer's private key and the preshared key: it is shown once, is not stored on this host, and gives whoever holds it access to the tunnel; pass it on over a channel you trust

$ jailops wireguard peer add office laptop
! already_exists: peer "laptop" of wireguard "office" already exists
! hint: Pick another name, or edit the existing object. (jailops explain already_exists)
[exit 5]

$ jailops wireguard peer list office
